## Features Implemented

1. **Two-Way Diff**
   - Compare exports between two assets
   - Compare properties recursively
   - Detect added/removed/modified changes
   - Rename detection with confidence scoring

2. **Three-Way Diff (Mod Porting)**
   - Compare original -> updated (game changes)
   - Compare original -> modded (mod changes)
   - Detect conflicts where both changed same property
   - Identify safe-to-apply changes

3. **Patch Generation**
   - Generate patches from diff results
   - Mark conflicting patches for review
   - Support set/add/remove/rename operations

4. **Patch Application**
   - Apply safe patches automatically
   - Resolve conflicts with user choice
   - Support custom value resolution

5. **UI Components**
   - Side-by-side diff view
   - Color-coded change highlighting
   - Conflict resolution panel
   - Filter by change type

## IPC Actions

| Action | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| compare | Two-way diff between assets |
| threeWayCompare | Three-way diff for mod porting |
| applySafe | Apply non-conflicting changes |
| resolveConflict | Resolve a specific conflict |
| clear | Clear diff state |
| generatePatches | Generate patch set |
| navigateTo | Navigate to change in tree |

